Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The resolver (auspex/) links the following Go modules. Their licenses apply
to their own code; see each project for the full text.

  github.com/miekg/dns              BSD-3-Clause
  golang.org/x/net                  BSD-3-Clause
  golang.org/x/sys                  BSD-3-Clause

The control plane (control/) builds on .NET and the following packages,
distributed under the MIT license by the .NET Foundation and contributors:

  Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite
  Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design

Auspex ships no blocklists. It reads lists that the operator configures; the
lists themselves remain under the terms set by whoever publishes them.

